{"reference":"Genesis 19","book":"Genesis","chapter":19,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Lot and moral complexity","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Lot is called righteous and distressed in a later reception of the story, but that selective description does not erase the moral complexity of Genesis 19. It also does not license victim blaming when the chapter's violence is discussed.","verse_refs":["Genesis 19:1-38"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_genesis_019_011ce8e20765f4404b98785b"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}
